// =====================================================================================
// D. Coverage check: is RunMRU telemetry actually reaching you?
//    Run this BEFORE trusting a zero-result from query A. A silent rule and a clean
//    estate look identical. If this returns nothing, the rule is blind, not passing.
// =====================================================================================
// DeviceRegistryEvents
// | where Timestamp > ago(7d)
// | where RegistryKey has @"\Explorer\RunMRU"
// | summarize Writes = count(), Devices = dcount(DeviceId), LastSeen = max(Timestamp)
